ntity_name":"Copley Square Park","title":"Pause at the Renovated Civic Square","subtitle":"Boylston Street corridor · Copley Square Park","notes":"Continue west on Boylston Street to use the renewed square’s seating and open space while viewing its surrounding architecture.","short_summary":"A recently renovated civic park anchoring the Boylston Street approach to Copley Square.","evidence_claim":"The City of Boston identifies Copley Square Park at 560 Boylston Street and reported in May 2026 that its renovation added accessibility improvements, trees, and upgraded infrastructure.","source_url":"https://www.boston.gov/calendar/back-bay-and-beacon-hill-coffee-hour","source_title":"Back Bay and Beacon Hill Coffee Hour","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":"2026-05-08","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":42.3498,"longitude":-71.0766,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Copley+Square+Park+560+Boylston+Street+Boston+MA","access_notes":"Public outdoor square; large civic events may temporarily alter circulation or available seating.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"bca-mills-gallery-tremont-street","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"BCA Mills Gallery","title":"Check the Current Contemporary Show","subtitle":"Tremont Street corridor · BCA Mills Gallery","notes":"Walk the South End stretch of Tremont Street, then check the exhibition dates before entering this contemporary-art space.","short_summary":"A contemporary gallery extending the Tremont Street arts corridor into the South End.","evidence_claim":"Boston Center for the Arts lists the Mills Gallery at 551 Tremont Street, describes its contemporary exhibitions, and states that admission is free.","source_url":"https://bostonarts.org/venue/mills-gallery/","source_title":"BCA Mills Gallery - Boston Center for the Arts","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":42.3446,"l